    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nThe version detection regex for wasmtime doesn't match multi-digit minor or patch version segments, which means that the bundled version could not be detected correctly if the version has a multi-digit minor or patch (see #41437).\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nAdd `+` to minor and patch version segments.",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-23T07:55:09Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "To build with `ENABLE_WASMTIME`, you need to set it both in `CMAKE_EXTRA_FLAGS` and `DEPS_CMAKE_FLAGS`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nmake DEPS_CMAKE_FLAGS='-DENABLE_WASMTIME=ON' CMAKE_EXTRA_FLAGS='-DENABLE_WASMTIME=ON'\r\n```\r\n\r\nIs this a problem with the build system, or is this expected?",
            "created_at": "2026-08-22T21:58:59Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/41438#issuecomment-5382815481",
